  m_Text: 'Echoes of the Valley

    A game for thatgamejam #02, 2026

    Created
    by the developer of this entry


    Made with AI assistance

    Code, writing,
    procedural art and sound: Anthropic Claude Code. Original Blender art, visual
    overhaul and tooling: OpenAI Codex. AI assistance was directed by the developer.


    Assets

    No
    external art, music, sound or font files are used. Music and sounds are original
    and synthesised procedurally. The interface uses the font and sprites built into
    Unity.


    Built with Unity 6 and its Universal Render Pipeline.


    Thank
    you for playing.'
